<title>HONG KONG: AsiaSat announces first final results.</title>
<headline>AsiaSat announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   101.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    394.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     823.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Satellite Telecommunications</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 16-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Satellite operator Asia Satellite is owned in equal parts by Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, Britain's Cable &amp; Wireless Plc and Beijing's state-owned flagship China International Trust and Investment Corp (CITIC). It was listed on the Stock Exchange on June 19, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
